# 24. Read & Write Optimization Rules

Always prefer:

- One larger document over many tiny documents when the data always belongs together.
- Embedded objects for task-specific data.
- Firestore queries instead of client-side filtering.
- Cached dashboard statistics.

Avoid:

- Loading entire collections.
- Nested queries inside loops.
- Duplicate queries.
- Frequent polling.

---

# 25. Firebase Spark Plan Optimization

The database is intentionally designed for the Firebase Spark plan.

Design decisions include:

- Only seven top-level collections.
- Embedded assignment data.
- Embedded proof data.
- Embedded timeline.
- Embedded summaries.
- No Cloud Functions.
- No unnecessary listeners.
- No custom backend.
- Lightweight dashboard.
- Efficient Firestore indexes.

The MVP should comfortably operate within Firebase Spark limits during development and demonstration.

---

